    "content": "TL;DR India\u2019s government is proposing a policy that would require smartphones to receive live TV signals without the need for cellular networks.\nMajor smartphone players like Samsung and Qualcomm are opposing the policy.\nOEMs fear that India\u2019s policy... [1815 chars]",
